    <string name="faq_q1">How do I reset my password?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">On the sign-in screen tap \"Forgot password?\", choose SMS or email, enter the 6-digit code and set a new password.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Can I see more than one child in the app?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Yes. Linked students appear on your profile — tap a student to switch between them.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">My fee payment isn\'t showing as paid</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Payments are marked paid after the accounts office verifies your proof. This can take up to 2 working days.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Attendance is marked wrong — what should I do?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Open the attendance screen and raise a concern, or contact your class teacher through the app.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">Can I reply to a voice message?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Yes. Open the message and tap reply to send a text or voice note back to faculty.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How do I turn on fingerprint sign-in?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Go to Settings and turn on Fingerprint / Face unlock to sign in without a password.</string>
